{"diagnosis": "Fetch TB stalls with max_addr=0x00000000 and FAIL 0xdead after 2009 cycles instead of advancing PC through NOPs. Expected mem_valid/mem_xfer handshake to progress fetches but FSM never reaches the wait-for-ack handling. Root cause is reset mem_state<=1 at line 568 combined with duplicated case 1: at line 582 (request state should be 0), leaving state 0 dead and state 1 shadowing the transfer branch so mem_xfer is never serviced.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -565,7 +565,7 @@
 	always @(posedge clk) begin
 		if (!resetn || trap) begin
 			if (!resetn)
-				mem_state <= 1;
+				mem_state <= 0;
 			if (!resetn || mem_ready)
 				mem_valid <= 0;
 			mem_la_secondword <= 0;
@@ -580,5 +580,5 @@
 			end
 			case (mem_state)
-				1: begin
+				0: begin
 					if (mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst || mem_do_rdata) begin
 						mem_valid <= !mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word;
", "expected": "tohost PASS (not FAIL 0xdead) with forward progress max_addr>0 and clean $finish in tb_picorv32_fetch"}

